    "detailed_description": "The title explains what it is.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n1. 14 minesweeper variants, each with four difficulties and hundreds of levels.<br />\r\n2. Learning new rule sets and their unique logic.<br />\r\n3. In case you need to take notes, there are built-in drawing tools.<br />\r\n4. The hint system tells you where to focus on when you get stuck, while it does not simply tell the solution.<br />\r\n5. Every level can be completed by logic. Guessing is not required.<br />\r\n6. The puzzles are procedurally generated. We tried a few programming and game design techniques in this game. I promise it doesn't feel like any other procedural generated game before.<br />\r\n7. And there's more to explore.",
    "about_the_game": "The title explains what it is.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n1. 14 minesweeper variants, each with four difficulties and hundreds of levels.<br />\r\n2. Learning new rule sets and their unique logic.<br />\r\n3. In case you need to take notes, there are built-in drawing tools.<br />\r\n4. The hint system tells you where to focus on when you get stuck, while it does not simply tell the solution.<br />\r\n5. Every level can be completed by logic. Guessing is not required.<br />\r\n6. The puzzles are procedurally generated. We tried a few programming and game design techniques in this game. I promise it doesn't feel like any other procedural generated game before.<br />\r\n7. And there's more to explore.",
    "short_description": "Minesweeper but the rules are changing.",
